{"id": "en_avalanche_p1", "total": 58.29, "segments": [{"text": "If an avalanche starts, do not run straight down the open mountain slope.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.24}, {"text": "Mark stands under a rock overhang when the white snow slab suddenly cracks.", "start": 3.8, "end": 6.94}, {"text": "Fast snow surges down the steep slope and hits him with total force.", "start": 7.58, "end": 10.36}, {"text": "Mark knows trapped victims must be dug out within about 15 fast minutes.", "start": 10.9, "end": 13.82}, {"text": "He moves fast to follow 3 essential rules to survive the slide.", "start": 14.42, "end": 16.78}, {"text": "One. He tries to get off the slab to the side as it starts.", "start": 17.42, "end": 19.98}, {"text": "The sweeping wave knocks Mark down into a fast violent downhill tumble.", "start": 20.44, "end": 23.44}, {"text": "Two. He uses swimming motions and dumps his heavy pack to stay up.", "start": 23.96, "end": 26.98}, {"text": "Staying on the surface protects his body as the heavy snow slows down.", "start": 26.98, "end": 30.18}, {"text": "Three. He cups 1 arm in front of his face for air.", "start": 30.8, "end": 33.26}, {"text": "Mark crouches down low under the moving snow to protect his chest space.", "start": 33.78, "end": 36.2}, {"text": "He pushes 1 hand up toward the surface as the snow stops.", "start": 36.66, "end": 38.98}, {"text": "Mark waves his raised hand above the quiet snow to signal his spot.", "start": 39.58, "end": 42.3}, {"text": "Crucial rescue gear includes a beacon, a probe, and 1 sturdy digging shovel.", "start": 42.94, "end": 46.14}, {"text": "Digging a victim out takes fast effort with proper avalanche safety tools.", "start": 46.8, "end": 49.42}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan to survive being swept in a slide.", "start": 50.0, "end": 51.96}, {"text": "There was just 1 problem, his rescue beacon was completely turned off.", "start": 52.44, "end": 55.14}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.36], ["an", 0.36, 0.46], ["avalanche", 0.46,